Hello all,

Following useful discussions in Darmstadt, the team are planning to
address a small number of long-standing issues in expl3. Some of that
will involve deprecations, which will then have some effect on
programmers using expl3. As usual, these changes will be notified when
made (by me) and the deprecated functions will not be removed until at
least the end of next year.
